Finally, we note that our analysis, while groundbreaking, may illuminate only a portion of this complex and underexplored problem. We envision our analytical framework as a foundational tool to pave the way for dissecting other critical graph learning tasks (such as link prediction and representation learning) and to generate actionable insights and methodologies for solving a wide array of practical GNN challenges. We conclude by discussing these expansive possibilities and related works. (\textbf{Section~\ref{sec_discussion}})",
