Furthermore, we validate the performance of the propose {\it MissDiff} on imputation tasks for the Census dataset. We compare {\it MissDiff} with state-of-the-art imputation approaches in Table \ref{tab:imputation}. The result shows that although designed for generation tasks, {\it MissDiff} also performs well for imputation tasks.

