\paragraph{Skills from Stronger Model vs. Skills from the Same Generative Model}
Another important question we want to understand is whether it is beneficial to generate the in-context skills from the same foundation model used for prediction. We prompt the ChatGPT using the SKiC constructed from itself or the stronger GPT-4 (i.e., the in-context skills are generated by GPT-4). The accuracy and the internal skill activation rate on MATH are reported in Table~\ref{Tab:math_simple_ablation_results} (see Table~\ref{Tab:math_ablation_results} for the complete result).
